	(text_box "Smart-CONFIG (SLVSGE0B Table 8-1 #13): MODE/S-CONF 64.9 k -> VSET, 1 MHz, output discharge active, auto PFM/PWM. VSET pin open -> 3.3 V (Table 8-2 #18 '249 k or larger/open'). Accuracy -1.3/+1.1 %\nover TJ -40..125 C -> 3.26-3.34 V.\nL 2.2 uH nominal (Table 7.3 1.0-4.7 uH): XAL4020-222ME (Isat 5.6 A, DCR 38.7 mOhm max); load 80 mA peak (design §B1.6). CIN 4.7 uF 25 V 1206 (TI list C3216X7R1E475K160AC); COUT 2 x 22 uF 10 V (>= 10\nuF effective after DC bias; Table 9-3 allows 10-200 uF with 2.2 uH).\nEN_MAIN (precise enable, 1.00 V rising / 0.90 V falling; internal pull-down): wired-OR of Q301 (power button), Q303 (RTC_INT_N, the wake timer holds INT low until cleared = latch), Q304 (DOCK_DET_N)\nand D301 (MAIN_KEEP). P-MOSFET drains drive 3V3_AON straight onto EN; the diode from MAIN_KEEP gives 3.3 - 0.85 = 2.45 V. R310 100 k defines EN low when all are off.\nFuse F301 SF-1206S100-2 (1 A slow blow, 50 A at 63 V DC interrupting, 0.132 ohm): input current about 45 mA average at 80 mA / 3.3 V / 6 V in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(size 224.99 17.113)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccf4bc8c-0178-5c9e-b6fb-b8c5ba1d586d")
	)
	(text_box "3V3_SUP: F302 1 A -> U302 TPS629210 (separate part, fuse and enable network from 3V3_MAIN)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270.71 25.4 0)
		(size 222.365 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31c07d62-254b-54ee-bccc-0e301603b797")
	)
	(text_box "Same configuration as U301. EN_SUP: wired-OR of Q302 (power button, a second P-MOSFET so no single transistor serves both regulators), and D302 (SUP_WAKE from the main for scheduled self-tests,\nSUP_KEEP from the supervisor). The supervisor domain shares nothing with the main domain on this sheet except VBAT_SYS, GND and the button line (design §B1.6, D-26)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270.71 31.75 0)
		(size 222.365 6.318)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88542697-fa1f-5787-9aa0-523dfc372adf")
	)
	(text_box "5V0_SYS: F303 3 A -> U303 TPS62130 (FB 107 k / 20.0 k = 5.08 V, 1.25 MHz, SS 4.7 nF), EN = EN_5V0 (default off)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 513.395 25.4 0)
		(size 212.215 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "134b555c-9e3b-5e06-88d9-35e4856c914f")
	)
	(text_box "VOUT = 0.8 V x (1 + 107/20.0) = 5.08 V (Eq 6). Chosen 1.6 % above 5.00 V so that the worst case stays >= 4.9 V (design §B1.6, LT3751 VCC lock-out): VFB 785.6-814.4 mV in PWM (SLVSAG7F EC)\nand 1 % resistors -> 4.96-5.20 V; in power-save mode (781.6-822.4 mV) 4.93-5.25 V.\nDropout: at 5.2 V pack and 1.2 A: (170 mOhm high-side max + 38.7 mOhm L + 23 mOhm fuse) x 1.2 A = 0.28 V -> 4.92 V in 100 % mode [CALC, ignores pack-path drop of ~0.1 V at 9.2 A charger\ncurrent: VERIFY with sheet 10's load timing].\nFSW tied to VOUT -> 1.25 MHz (pin table note 2); DEF low -> nominal voltage. Soft start Css = tSS x 2.5 uA / 1.25 V (Eq 10): 4.7 nF -> 2.35 ms. L 2.2 uH XAL4020-222ME (Isat 5.6 A > 1.2 A\n+ ripple); CIN 10 uF 25 V 1210 + 0.1 uF at AVIN (§9.2.2.2); COUT 2 x 22 uF 10 V.\nEN = EN_5V0 with R305 100 k pull-down (contract): 5V0_SYS is off unless the main asks for it; loss of 5V0_SYS is a safe failure (design §B1.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 513.395 31.75 0)
		(size 212.215 17.113)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ffb79bbc-a9d6-5d09-ac28-23a35ea766b1")
	)
	(text_box "3V3_AON: U304 TPS70933 from VBAT_SYS, always on; EN from a 4.7 M / 3.3 M divider (EN max 6.5 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 513.395 137.793 0)
		(size 171.53 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f26bb910-d21a-5eb6-988a-19506b237a76")
	)
	(text_box "EN abs max 7 V, recommended <= 6.5 V (SBVS186H 6.1, 6.3), VEN(HI) >= 0.9 V: EN = VBAT_SYS x 3.3/8.0 = 2.27 V at 5.5 V, 3.47 V at 8.4 V. Divider current\n1.05 uA at 8.4 V (part of the standby budget; design §12 'disabled regulators, eFuse off ~4 uA' row).\nCIN 1 uF (0.1-2.2 uF advised); COUT 2.2 uF (1.5-47 uF for stability). Load 5 mA peak / 10 uA standby (design §B1.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 513.395 144.143 0)
		(size 171.53 8.477)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
