				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8a5ca4c-16dc-5280-92e0-935792441ba0")
	)
	(text_box "D = READY_D, CLK = READY_CLK (1 M pull-downs: contract). ~PRE tied high. ~CLR held low for about 100 ms after 3V3_AON appears (R320 1 M x C316 100 nF, Schmitt\ninputs Vhys 250 mV typ, SCES644D): the indicator starts 'not ready' instead of a random state (R11: an unpowered or reset latch must not show READY).\nLED: Q output -> R321 470 ohm -> D303 (Kingbright APT1608SGC green, VF 2.2 V typ at 20 mA) -> Q305 BSS138 -> GND. Q305 gate is RTC_CLKOUT differentiated by C317\n33 nF / R322 100 k (tau 3.3 ms): on for about tau x ln(3.3/VGS) = 2-4 ms after each rising edge (VGS(th) 0.8-1.5 V). Current (3.0 - 1.9 V) / 470 = 2.3 mA;\naverage 2.3 mA x 3 ms/s = 7 uA, 23 uW at 3.3 V (design §B10 '~20 uW')."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 179.703 0)
		(size 183.08 12.795)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
